# (c) Bad luck plus a player-caused audit: the colony is lost.
# GDD: 35 (max random) + a 14-Sol audit = Sol 49. Hypoxia Sols 45-47,
# crew unconscious Sol 48, colony lost from Sol 49 with an autopsy log.
seed 7                          # severe drift +10 outbound
orders caretaker
run-to 10
split cal,jonathan,dax
close
launch
fly overclock
expect sol 25
expect random-delay 10
close
# Not built yet from here (docking: milestone 7).
dock
haggle salt-the-crates          # deception raises Station Heat
audit 14                        # uncapped: player-caused
return
land
expect sol 49
screenshot autopsy
